.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
docs
*.md
.github

# The image builds the screen itself, so a bundle left in the tree by a local
# build would only be copied in ahead of the one the image makes.
**/dist

# Kept out of the image as well as out of git. COPY apps ./apps would otherwise
# pick up an .env someone left in the tree.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
